 "id": 1516785,
 "titulo": "5/15 Patch Details",
 "fecha": 1557826393362,
 "modificada": 1788847663372,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1516785",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1557808782440\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/421d17eea92d45d1bc0f19a636a81448_1557808782440_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents!</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">CM Fragment back again with some wonderful news.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We want to cherish the memories of Avengers: Endgame within MARVEL Future Fight, we would like to introduce the second part of the Avengers: Endgame update!</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We’ve added <strong>Rescue</strong>&nbsp;to help Iron Man in times of need. <strong>Thor gets a new uniform</strong>, sweeping enemies with both Stormbreaker and Mjölnir. We have also prepared <strong>a new uniform for Captain Marvel</strong>, the protector and bringer of peace throughout the galaxy.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">And to help welcome the new uniforms during the events of Avengers: Endgame, we have also added <strong>a new Uniform Collection with the theme of MARVEL’S&nbsp;<em>Avengers: Endgame</em></strong>.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We are also preparing some enhancements to our characters from MARVEL’s <em>Avengers: Endgame</em> update as we announced back in our last notice. (4/30) We will inform you as soon as possible when the details are confirmed.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">See all the new characters and uniforms in this upcoming update on 5/15.</span></span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>■5/15 Patch Details</strong></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Added 1 New Character</strong></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The new CEO of Stark Industries, Pepper Potts, finally joins the battlefield in her debut suit, Rescue.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1557825588875\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/05f312ff27964bc3ac494c8122eaf585_1557825588875_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">*All skills are based on Skill Level 1.</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Added 3 New Uniforms</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The newly joined Avenger, Captain Marvel, and Thor God of Thunder are back again with some new looks and abilities.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Three new uniforms have been added to show the power of these two characters from MARVEL’s Avengers: Endgame.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1557825599736\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/2caaf6e9f2384d80bfb373df909033bd_1557825599736_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">*All skills are based on Skill Level 1<br>\n* The three new uniforms will be sold at a discounted price during the event period.<br>\nYou can check the uniforms in the Marvel Universe menu and by going to the Uniform Room.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">*Captain Marvel MARVEL'S <em>AVENGERS: ENDGAME</em> uniform will have Uniform Synergy with Captain Marvel MARVEL'S <em>CAPTAIN MARVEL</em> uniform.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">*Thor MARVEL'S <em>AVENGERS: ENDGAME</em> uniform will have Uniform Synergy with Thor Team Suit uniform.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Added a Uniform Collection [Avengers: Endgame]</strong></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A special Uniform Collection has been added to commemorate MARVEL’s Avengers: Endgame.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1557825616960\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/496064ac810f4adb992f72908fd17352_1557825616960_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">You can register your uniforms in a collection once it meets the specified conditions.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1557825628759\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/913fdc8ee3ff47c984d94637b5d380b1_1557825628759_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ 11 More Characters Can Realize Their Potential</strong></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#000000\">This May update will allow you to realize the Potential of the characters listed below.</font></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Rescue<br>\n- Gamora<br>\n- Red Skull<br>\n- Drax<br>\n- Vision<br>\n- Falcon<br>\n- Crossbones<br>\n- Wong<br>\n-Ancient One<br>\n- Valkyrie&nbsp;<br>\n- Shuri</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">You can now raise them up to Level 70.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1557809039082\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/29fe1e1309334bb3b20e2467158da605_1557809039082_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Other Fixes</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. An issue with Ant-Man MARVEL’s Avengers: Endgame and Team Suit uniform’s active 5 skill, Pym Discs, has been fixed.<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Fixed an issue where non target spell effects were not being applied correctly.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. Captain America MARVEL’s Avengers: Endgame and Team Suit “Heroic Charge” skill has been fixed.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1557826385381\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/8151ef0152004df4963839582a069064_1557826385381_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n"
}